## 3. Symptom → fix

| Symptom | Fix |
|---|---|
| `FileNotFoundException at MS.Internal.NativeWPFDLLLoader.LoadCommonDLLsAndDwrite()` | Missing native .NET — `winetricks -f corefonts dotnet48` (2.3) |
| Mono or `wpfgfx_cor3.dll` errors despite "already installed" | winetricks false positive — force reinstall with `-f` (2.3) |
| `unimplemented function msdelta.dll.ApplyDeltaW, aborting` | `winetricks msdelta` on the Steam prefix (2.4) |
| `exit code 80131506` **with** the msdelta message | Same as above (2.4) |
| `exit code 80131506` from the installer, run against the Steam prefix | Unsolved — use the disposable prefix (1, 7.2) |
| `exit code 80131506` from the app exe, no `packages/` folder present | Unsolved — install properly via Part A (7.1) |
| `wine client error:0: version mismatch` | Wrong Wine build for that prefix (2.1) |
| `System.IO.DirectoryNotFoundException` | Wrong username in path — `steamuser` vs `$USER` (2.2) |
| `getcwd(): No such file or directory` | `cd` into a stable directory before launching Wine (2.6) |
| Battle.net and HDT won't run together | Stop launching via Lutris/Bottles (2.5) |
| Overlay needs double-clicks | Update HDT to ≥ v1.56.3 (2.6) |
| Login does nothing, no browser opens | Known, two causes — use token transfer (5) |

