## 8. Untested environments

Wayland (X11 tooling in 2.6 doesn't apply; overlay behaviour under XWayland
unknown) · desktop environments other than Cinnamon (overlay click behaviour is
known to vary — KDE, XFCE and tiling WMs all differ) · Flatpak Steam (extra sandbox
layer could compound the portal issue in Section 5) · non-NVIDIA GPUs · fresh Steam
prefixes with respect to 7.2 · HDT versions past v1.57.4.

